## UI / visual work
- Anything that changes what a user sees: design it first as an SVG or HTML/CSS draft with the
  svg-ui-bridge skill (`/svg-ui-bridge:svg-ui-bridge` when installed as a plugin, `svg-ui-bridge` when
  uploaded to the account) and get my approval in its browser preview. A design-only request ends
  there. When I ask for implementation, build it per component and verify it (visual_diff on the SVG
  route). With superpowers this happens inside brainstorming's design step, not instead of it.
- Visual change requests edit the design first; the approved draft in `design/` is the source of truth for looks.
